[0;38;5;117;1m┃[0m   The interactive picker and explicit Profile subcommands share the same managed Profile registry. Removal is permanent and is named remove, not delete, in the CLI.            [0;38;5;117;1m┃[0m
[2C[0m  - SELECT · Press Enter in the picker, or use mem profile use.                      [0m
[C[0m   - RENAME · Press R in the picker, or use mem profile rename; mem rename is the top-level shortcut.                                                                            [0m
[C[0m   - REMOVE · Press D in the picker, or use mem profile remove. Switch away before removing the current Profile.                                                                 [0m
